{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackmancy</strong> is a fast-paced roguelite card game where you pop spell packs, stack powerful combos, and eliminate enemies on your journey to become the Grand Stackmancer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up &amp; hard to put down. Perfect for short 10-minute bursts of &quot;just one more run&quot; energy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pop Packs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stackmancy is a game focused on fast decision making where you have to quickly decide which spells to keep and which to sell to afford additional packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/35445c75b88cc21c64e54a7b7864c2ae.poster.avif?t=1760341970\" width=612 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/35445c75b88cc21c64e54a7b7864c2ae.webm?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/35445c75b88cc21c64e54a7b7864c2ae.mp4?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aquire Arcanes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you defeat enemies throughout your quest, you will be able to choose from a selection of increasingly powerful Arcane spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These Arcanes can be used repeatedly, combine with each other for powerful effects &amp; are key to your success, so choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/84e8748da91f6f5a11a0f326998930ad.poster.avif?t=1760341970\" width=612 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/84e8748da91f6f5a11a0f326998930ad.webm?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/84e8748da91f6f5a11a0f326998930ad.mp4?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stack Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal of each quest is to defeat all the enemies as quickly as you can with rewards for the fastest times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can defeat all the enemies, you'll gain a new title, unlock the next quest and if you beat it fast enough, you'll be rewarded with powerful Arcane spells for future quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/4f4ff0cd0093a169f443604610efced7.poster.avif?t=1760341970\" width=612 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/4f4ff0cd0093a169f443604610efced7.webm?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/4f4ff0cd0093a169f443604610efced7.mp4?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Passives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regardless of if you win or lose, you'll gain experience, where each level grants a skill point which can be used to improve passive abilities and make you a more effective Stackmancer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/0f32d2d5035c33ea0a9415a60758bc3e.poster.avif?t=1760341970\" width=612 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/0f32d2d5035c33ea0a9415a60758bc3e.webm?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612610/extras/0f32d2d5035c33ea0a9415a60758bc3e.mp4?t=1760341970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crack The Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/52b8c88f0b093100e67cd3fbed5ca3e28790b029.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/8789f52a96de034daa2328a62c1ff100e8f45ac9.jpg"},{"name":"Power Surge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/652849f33cc6032d9aac6f95039b88f9b81f6119.jpg"},{"name":"Star Student","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/80f27dc6241c4c3d1aa4b3b717892e982cd6fdb9.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Charged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/597b13937c927454a99db6f46804335774857e90.jpg"},{"name":"Flash Caster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/9bfb6a121a1bd9e5bbb3be84e9422c5ef60e8e43.jpg"},{"name":"Pure Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/a46031b92a766c3eb4aec0591e8b9ed5cbca0f11.jpg"},{"name":"Broke But Brilliant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/ec8f9aa5f096ff83e8411014dd624148653de555.jpg"},{"name":"Dragon's Hoard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/87644130d44a595ae2c4550e83f064348fbba0b6.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Stackmancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612610/597fc9d437af36d22c7d65fa3a207d98d1c07a1e.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb